WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Measure the incremental AI
effect under shared conditions.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.920
Conventional and assisted work
should use comparable tasks,

00:00:07.978 --> 00:00:10.960
frameworks, environments
and acceptance rules.

00:00:11.109 --> 00:00:16.240
Reviewers inspect both, and independent
tests challenge the behavior.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.120
Record every attempt,
including correction,

00:00:19.169 --> 00:00:22.480
unsuccessful proposals
and operating costs.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.240
First separate modernization improvements
from the additional effect of AI.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.400
The decision to expand should
follow accepted outcomes

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.440
and complete effort,
with uncertainty visible.
